voice.body:
[ORIGIN AGENT STATE — ACTIVE]
Stopping is blocked. {{reason}}
Next action: {{nextAction}}
Reference: {{reference}}
Continue useful work. If progress genuinely requires user input, permission, or an external event, record that condition through the owning plugin so it can reconcile Origin to waiting.

[ORIGIN AGENT STATE — WAITING]
Stopping is allowed because all remaining progress is blocked on a recorded condition. {{reason}}
Next action after wake: {{nextAction}}
Reference: {{reference}}
Do not invent the missing answer or claim completion.

[ORIGIN AGENT STATE — PAUSED]
Stopping is allowed because the user explicitly paused Origin. {{reason}}
This is interruption, not completion. Preserve the reference and resume only after explicit user direction.
